+type: task
+title: "Reject invalid input when adding, renaming or tagging"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+`add`, `rename` and `tag` now reject invalid input with a new error code `invalid-input` and a message
+saying what is wrong: a title empty/blank or over 120 characters (after trimming), a priority other than
+low/normal/high, a tag that is empty or contains whitespace (also checked for the tags of `add`).
+Validation runs before any change, so a rejected call leaves the list (and the id counter) untouched.
+`createTask`, `renameTask` and `addTag` now return a `Result`. Tests in `test/list.test.ts`.
